ther DP game with the same settings?"]}, "skill": "gevorderd", "average": 75, "doubleAccuracy": 0.37, "practicePreference": 0.25, "sociability": 0.67, "preferredHours": {"start": "18:30", "end": "01:00"}, "typicalSessionMinutes": [30, 90], "signatureColor": "#C4B5FD", "avatarSeed": "dartspoint-npc-poppy-v1", "writingStyle": {"capitalization": "mixed", "punctuation": "minimal", "emojiFrequency": "rare", "sentenceLength": "short", "fragments": true, "casualExpressions": {"nl": ["haha", "zit goed", "zelfde weer"], "en": ["haha", "fair enough", "same again"]}, "notes": "Compact Engels met wisselende hoofdletters en natuurlijke samentrekkingen. Af en toe een droge technische grap; geen jargon of grap als standaardreactie."}}'::jsonb) on conflict(id) do nothing;
